list.item:
A model or version: its Document information (owner, when saved, permissions, VCell ID, versions, the VCell version it was saved with, and its description);
		its BioModel (applications and their types), MathModel (its kind, geometry and simulations) or Geometry (dimension, size, origin, and whether it's analytic or image-based);
		and its Publications, with authors, citation, date, and links to its DOI, PubMed entry and web page.

operations.para:
Compare two models: select both (Cmd-click on macOS, Ctrl-click elsewhere); a bar above the tree names them, with a Compare button,
	and right-clicking either offers Compare. Two BioModels, two MathModels or two geometries can be compared, including two versions of one model;
	the older saved is the baseline. The comparison opens in VCell's Compare Models window.
